font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Caffeine Cache</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> /&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Spring Cache</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> 60 giây) để tránh gửi HTTP request liên tục lên Langfuse Server ở mỗi lượt gọi LLM, giảm latency xuống ~0ms.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Tầng 3 - Defensive Fallback:</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Đặt logic lấy prompt trong khối&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-a